# =====================================================================
# SIH26044 Portal Database Configuration
# =====================================================================
# If DATABASE_URL is left empty, the portal automatically runs with local SQLite (portal.db).
# To connect to Neon or Supabase Cloud PostgreSQL, paste your connection string below:

# 1. Neon Serverless PostgreSQL Example:
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql+pg8000://alex:my-password@ep-cool-butterfly-123456.us-east-2.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require

# 2. Supabase PostgreSQL Example:
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql+pg8000://postgres:yourpassword@db.projectref.supabase.co:5432/postgres?sslmode=require
